Adapted (modified for Relay; changes include: lens reports as JSON, deterministic
consolidation in code instead of a synthesizer agent, round caps of 3 with one
clean round, Relay artefact layout and gates):
  - lib/docreview.mjs
  - schemas/docreview-lens.schema.json
  - agents/relay-doc-reviewer.md
  - the doc-review steps in skills/relay/SKILL.md and docs/doc-review.md

From EGM: fresh-context lens reviewers that see only the document, the
comprehension (paraphrase) test, finding settle/reopen logic, resolve
classification (contest needs checkable evidence, severity never lowered),
bounded review rounds, and the author-decides rule. EGM branding and assets
are not used. EGM is not affiliated with or endorsing Relay.